<title>FRANCE: Synthelabo 1996 sales up 11.9 percent.</title>
<headline>Synthelabo 1996 sales up 11.9 percent.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					10,425    up  11.4 pct</p>
<p>Breakdown of sales by field of activities</p>
<p>    -- central nervous system		  3,088    up  24.4 pct</p>
<p>    -- cardiovascular			    2,814    up   5.8 pct</p>
<p>    -- internal medicine			 2,239    up  17.9 pct</p>
<p>    -- semi-ethicals and OTC		   1,702    up   0.7 pct</p>
<p>    -- chemicals and other			 372  down  15.4 pct</p>
<p>    -- generics					209    up  11.6 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Synthelabo gave the figures in a statement. The company is 56.64 percent owned by L'Oreal</p>
</text>
